\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 53.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -53.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">캡스톤디자인 경진대회 참가 신청작 중 참여기업이 있는 건</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기업이 주제를 제시한 건</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">은</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 53.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -53.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 해당기업의 기술이전 의사여부를 확인하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기술이전 의사가 있을 시 동의서 첨부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 66.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -66.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ？ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">해당 대학에서는 참여기업으로부터 동의서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또는 공문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 받아 향후</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"> 해당 건의 공개 및</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 66.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -66.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">자에의 기술이전 등으로 법률적 분쟁 및 협력 관계를 손상하지 않도록 주의 요망</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">심사방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">: </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">첨부파일 확인 필수</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">3. </span><span style=\"F